{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜哇——！爱理，完蛋了——！」", "text_idx": 175, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1422", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「搞什么，烦死了。\\n　“新吾”又去闻“美羽”的屁股了？」", "text_idx": 178, "plain": "「搞什么，烦死了。　“新吾”又去闻“美羽”的屁股了？」", "plain_idx": 179, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4428", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜呜呜……」", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1423", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我开玩笑的，没想到真是这样啊」", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4429", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不论是不是考试期间，我们的活动室吵闹依旧。", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪又在为小猫们一惊一乍了。", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "担心着它们万一真开始交尾了该怎么办这些琐事……", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「总觉得，“美羽”来了之后“新吾”对我就变得冷淡了」", "text_idx": 189, "plain": "「总觉得，“美羽”来了之后“新吾”对我就变得冷淡了」", "plain_idx": 189, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1424", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「之前还老黏着我，现在连睡觉都要和“美羽”待在一起……」", "text_idx": 191, "plain": "「之前还老黏着我，现在连睡觉都要和“美羽”待在一起……」", "plain_idx": 191, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1425", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「毕竟它们是同类嘛，肯定比对人类亲近……」", "text_idx": 193, "plain": "「毕竟它们是同类嘛，肯定比对人类亲近……」", "plain_idx": 193, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4430", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「话是这么说……唉」", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn1426", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那边气氛还挺阴郁的」", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0652", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「太阳打西边出来了？隼太居然会来活动室……」", "text_idx": 199, "plain": "「太阳打西边出来了？隼太居然会来活动室……」", "plain_idx": 199, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那当然是因为担心你啊」", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0653", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我？」", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「之后怎么样了？」", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0654", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「看你一脸自信的样子，难道说……登上大人的阶梯了？」", "text_idx": 206, "plain": "「看你一脸自信的样子，难道说……登上大人的阶梯了？」", "plain_idx": 206, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0655", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喂，说点什么。昨天你还是一副看破红尘的样子」", "text_idx": 208, "plain": "「喂，说点什么。昨天你还是一副看破红尘的样子」", "plain_idx": 208, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0656", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太将我的头夹在腋下，用拳头钻着我的脑袋。", "text_idx": 210, "plain": "隼太将我的头夹在腋下，用拳头钻着我的脑袋。", "plain_idx": 210, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「之前多谢你了」", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘿嘿，之后你也要听听我的烦恼」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0657", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「诶，隼太也会有烦恼？」", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「当然。我的烦恼如天上的星星，地上的尘埃一般多」", "text_idx": 215, "plain": "「当然。我的烦恼如天上的星星，地上的尘埃一般多」", "plain_idx": 215, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0658", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在压力积攒下，总有一天我也会看破红尘的。", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「总之，祝贺你」", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0659", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「谢了」", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你以为我真心祝福你吗？\\n　可恶，一个人擅自登上了大人的台阶」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": "「你以为我真心祝福你吗？　可恶，一个人擅自登上了大人的台阶」", "plain_idx": 222, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0660", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「阶梯之上有着你所不知道的广阔世界哦」", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「烦死了！\\n　赶紧从上面摔下来」", "text_idx": 225, "plain": "「烦死了！　赶紧从上面摔下来」", "plain_idx": 226, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0661", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小熊喵～？小熊喵～？」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1766", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「学姐，怎么了？」", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……新吾，看见小熊喵了吗？」", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1767", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说起来今天一直没见着啊……」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……跑到哪去了呢？平时只要喊它的名字就会出来的……」", "text_idx": 235, "plain": "「……跑到哪去了呢？平时只要喊它的名字就会出来的……」", "plain_idx": 235, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1768", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽学姐看着给小熊喵新做的尾饰，消沉地耷拉着肩。", "text_idx": 237, "plain": "美羽学姐看着给小熊喵新做的尾饰，消沉地耷拉着肩。", "plain_idx": 237, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一定是在哪散步呢」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「希望如此……不过之前妈妈也说过，珍稀动物会被抓起来的……」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": "「希望如此……不过之前妈妈也说过，珍稀动物会被抓起来的……」", "plain_idx": 239, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1769", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "的确。", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "长久的陪伴使得我们容易忽视一个事实，那就是小熊喵本不是应该出现在这里的动物。", "text_idx": 242, "plain": "长久的陪伴使得我们容易忽视一个事实，那就是小熊喵本不是应该出现在这里的动物。", "plain_idx": 242, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "它应该是某种生活在森林深处的生物。", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1770", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没事的，小熊喵可比看起来可靠多了」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": "「没事的，小熊喵可比看起来可靠多了」", "plain_idx": 245, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，也是……」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1771", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「在活动室里多等一会儿吧？」", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾时间上可以吗？」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1772", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「为了学姐，就算不行我也会腾出时间来」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「诶，勉强自己可不好～」", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1773", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「牵着手不太好吧。要是谁还没回去的话……」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": "「牵着手不太好吧。要是谁还没回去的话……」", "plain_idx": 254, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1774", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「找个时间和大家说了吧」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1775", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「可以吗？不说会不会更好……」", "text_idx": 258, "plain": "「可以吗？不说会不会更好……」", "plain_idx": 258, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不可能一直隐瞒下去的，而且……」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1776", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「果然，还是因为我想得到大家的祝福……」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": "「果然，还是因为我想得到大家的祝福……」", "plain_idx": 261, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1777", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊，我也这么想」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我由衷感到高兴。", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐下定决心将我们的关系公之于众。", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这不是为了向谁炫耀。", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只是为了能无所顾忌地与学姐一同度过所剩不多的校园生活，不用再因为担心身边的人而陷入寂寞之中。", "text_idx": 267, "plain": "只是为了能无所顾忌地与学姐一同度过所剩不多的校园生活，不用再因为担心身边的人而陷入寂寞之中。", "plain_idx": 267, "len": 46, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我一定会让学姐幸福的」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也会让新吾幸福」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1778", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我现在就很幸福」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那就让你比现在更幸福」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1779", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我也会让学姐感到更加更加幸福」", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们牵着手，交换着孩童般的痴话。", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我从未怀疑与学姐的幸福未来。", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——我们会成为受大家祝福的一对……", "text_idx": 277, "plain": "——我们会成为受大家祝福的一对……", "plain_idx": 277, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我由衷地如此希望。", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_13.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "为此，我们将携手前行。", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
